# AI Agent 指南（指针）

索引：`docs/ai-agent-guidelines/README.md`  
底线：`docs/ai-agent-guidelines/ai/constitution.md`

| 任务 | 读 |
|------|-----|
| 文档开篇 / 范围 | `docs/ai-agent-guidelines/ai/tech-writing.md` |
| 写代码 | `docs/ai-agent-guidelines/ai/coding.md` |
| Tabs / effect 回写 | `docs/ai-agent-guidelines/ai/pitfalls/react-effect-tabs.md` |
| i18n 文案 | `docs/ai-agent-guidelines/ai/pitfalls/i18n-csv-only.md` |

